#. Plugin Name of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "Xorro Direct Wallet Payments for WooCommerce"
msgstr "Xorro Paiements de portefeuille direct pour WooCommerce"

#. Plugin URI of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"
msgstr "https://github.com/x-o-r-r-o/xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce"

#. Description of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "Accept cryptocurrency payments directly to your own wallets — no third-party payment processor. Supports BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ and 200+ coins/tokens with automatic on-chain verification."
msgstr "Acceptez les paiements de cryptomonnaie directement à vos propres portefeuilles — aucun processeur de paiement tiers. Supporte BTC, BCH, ETH, USDT, USDC, DAI, TON, ADA, APT, KAS, XTZ et 200+ pièces / jetons avec vérification automatique sur la chaîne."

#. Author of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
msgid "xorro"
msgstr "xorro"

#. Author URI of the plugin
#: xorro-direct-wallet-payments-woocommerce.php
